{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"In general, to find the derivative (i.e. the expression for $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ ) of a function defined parametrically by the equations $x=u(t)$ and $y=v(t)$ (where $u$ and $v$ are any functions of $t$), we use the following rule:\n\n$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{\\left(\\dfrac{dy}{dt}\\right)}{\\left(\\dfrac{dx}{dt}\\right)}=\\dfrac{v'(t)}{u'(t)}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"We are given that $x=2\\cos(-t)$ and $y=5\\sin(2t)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dt}(5\\sin(2t))}{\\dfrac{d}{dt}(2\\cos(-t))}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{10\\cos{(2t)}}{2\\sin(-t)}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{10\\cos({2t})}{-2\\sin(t)}\\qquad\\gray{\\text{Simplify}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now let's evaluate $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ at $t=\\blueD {\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}}$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\dfrac{10\\cos{\\left(2\\left(\\blueD{\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}}\\right)\\right)}}{-2\\sin\\left(\\blueD{\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}}\\right)}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{10\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\right)}{-2\\sin\\left({\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}}\\right)}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{10\\cdot \\dfrac12}{-2\\cdot \\dfrac12}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-5\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, the value of $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ at $t=\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}$ is $-5$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"A curve in the plane is defined parametrically by the equations $x=2\\cos(-t)$ and $y=5\\sin(2t)$.\n\n**Find the value of $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ at $t=\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}$.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$-5$","correct":true},{"content":"$5$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\dfrac{2}{5}$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"$\\dfrac{5}{2}$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"onePerLine":false,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
